@startuml
[*] --> New : Initial State
New --> Registered : Successful registration
Registered --> Logged In : Login attempt validated
Logged In --> Account Management : User selects account management option
Account Management --> Logout : After completing account management actions
Logged In --> Ticket Booking : User initiates ticket booking process
Ticket Booking --> Payment Confirmation : After payment confirmation
Payment Confirmation --> Logout : After completing ticket booking process
[*] --> Logout : Final State

@enduml
